# The builder needs scripts/ and tests/ in context: the env-example generator
# has a no-git filesystem fallback that scans them, and build tooling reads
# regression fixtures under tests/ and backend/**/tests/. Keep those build-time
# inputs in the context. The final runtime stage still copies only the
# backend/shared/config/dist assets, so scripts and tests do not ship.

docs
*.md
!docs/
!docs/Payment_sheet_Grantflow_2026-06-15_EXTRACT.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
dist
coverage
